   357	  - ϑ′ is monotone away from 0, since Y_ω > |M₀| when H > dωV. So ϑ′ = Σ_{y≥Y_ω} (W_y Unif[0, y] +
   358	    W_{−y} Unif[−y, 0)), with W ≥ 0 and |1 − ΣW| ≤ 2/ω.
