   564	### Irreducibility and degree [PROVED elementary estimate]
   565	
   566	These are not needed for the analytic LD* inequality, but are useful for checking the field design. Uniformly in fixed g,z, the probability that F has degree less than d or is reducible over Q is at most H_R^{-1/4+o(1)}.
